{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55821","headline":"欧阳长官见迓约余买邻作此奉呈 · 詹敦仁","name":"欧阳长官见迓约余买邻作此奉呈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一识荆州面，令人意气舒。\n知心真我辈，遂性即吾庐。\n佛耳云堪扫，湖山水可渔。\n明朝整琴剑，踏雪醉骑驴。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹敦仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55821.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55821","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}